scenes|scene_06_shadow_syndicate.txt;scene_08_afghanistan_battle.txt
beat|There was unrest throughout the region; factions sought power in secret and alliances were formed and broken in secret, while the common people suffered. Lucky and Astra journeyed toward the desert city, having received word that a transaction of unusual importance was soon to take place there. The matter concerned a weapon whose destructive power was beyond that of ordinary arms; many sought either to possess it or to prevent its use. They entered the city under cover of evening while dust blew through the streets, and the city was crowded with travelers, traders, soldiers, refugees, and concealed spies who watched for masters near and far.

